<title>USA: Stearns says Harriman estate to sell stake.</title>
<headline>Stearns says Harriman estate to sell stake.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Ohio 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stearns &amp; Lehman Inc said on Wednesday that Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc intended to liquidate the late Pamela Harriman's estate holdings of all stocks, including 149,084 shares of common stock of Stearns &amp; Lehman.</p>
<p>Stearns &amp; Lehman also said there were 3.23 million common shares outstanding.</p>
